r\">Nonn.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">D.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">44.241</span> </span>.—Verb and compds. are almost exclus. poet. and <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span>, but used once or twice in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> </span> and <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> </span>, and late Prose. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Act.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">change, exchange,</b> (not <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> </span>), <span class=\"gk\">ἔντε' ἄμειβεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">17.192</span> </span>, etc.: <span class=\"gk\">τί τινος,</span> as <span class=\"gk\">γόνυ γουνὸς ἀμείβων</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">changing</b> one knee for other, i. e. walking slowly, ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.547</span> </span>, etc.:—so either, </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">1</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">give in exchange,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ὃς πρὸς Τυδεΐδην Διομήδεα τεύχε' ἄμειβε χρύσεα χαλκείων</span> ib. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.235</span> </span>: c.acc., <span class=\"gk\">δάμαρτ' ἀμείψας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Alc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">46</span> </span>: or more freq., </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">take in exchange,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τι ἀντί τινος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">P.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.17</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> 